  "description": "The ruthless yet gentle ruler Heart,\nthe serial killer Mad Hatter, the split-personality gang boss Twins… …\nAll of this\nbegan before the arrival of 'Alice,' when a woman stepped into the reverse harem novel 'Wonderland'.\n\nWonderland, a city of criminals and trash.\nThere, she is the White Rabbit, a messenger and maintainer of order.\nWhat drives this dimension-traveler is the hope that\nif she helps the protagonist Alice bring the story to a close,\nshe might be able to return to her family.\nHowever, even after Alice's arrival,\nthe men who should have been hers\nfail to fulfill their roles, merely hovering around Soyoon, and\ntheir obsession and blind devotion only intensify.\n\n**Original Novel:**  \n[Chapters](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=3073183), [Volumes](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=2829908)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=826848), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11141303)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=S142194)",
